youtubei%2Fv1%2Fbrowse%2Fedit_playlist%22%7D%7D%2C%22playlistEditEndpoint%22%3A%7B%22playlistId%22%3A%22WL%22%2C%22actions%22%3A%5B%7B%22addedVideoId%22%3A%22-JbHToroqqM%22%2C%22action%22%3A%22ACTION_ADD_VIDEO%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%2C%22removeFromWatchLaterCommand%22%3A%7B%22clickTrackingParams%22%3A%22CAAQu2kiEwjvh7iE8quWAxV443IJHfJBGq7KAQQz2CNs%22%2C%22commandMetadata%22%3A%7B%22webCommandMetadata%22%3A%7B%22sendPost%22%3Atrue%2C%22apiUrl%22%3A%22%2Fyoutubei%2Fv1%2Fbrowse%2Fedit_playlist%22%7D%7D%2C%22playlistEditEndpoint%22%3A%7B%22playlistId%22%3A%22WL%22%2C%22actions%22%3A%5B%7B%22action%22%3A%22ACTION_REMOVE_VIDEO_BY_VIDEO_ID%22%2C%22removedVideoId%22%3A%22-JbHToroqqM%22%7D%5D%7D%7D%7D%7D%7D%2C%22microformat%22%3A%7B%22playerMicroformatRenderer%22%3A%7B%22thumbnail%22%3A%7B%22thumbnails%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fi.ytimg.com%2Fvi%2F-JbHToroqqM%2Fmaxresdefault.jpg%22%2C%22width%22%3A1280%2C%22height%22%3A720%7D%5D%7D%2C%22embed%22%3A%7B%22iframeUrl%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2Fembed%2F-JbHToroqqM%22%2C%22width%22%3A1280%2C%22height%22%3A720%7D%2C%22title%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22Leo%E2%80%99s+Money+Logic%22%7D%2C%22description%22%3A%7B%22simpleText%22%3A%22We+all+have+our+own+unique+money+logic.+With+a+Clear+Access+Banking+Account%2C+Leo+has+no+overdraft+fees+and+tools+to+track+spending.+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5CnLearn+more+at+https%3A%2F%2Fwelcome.wf.com%2Fmoneysmart%2F%3Ffocus%3Dstartsmart%5Cu0026utm_campaign%3D26_pcm_cons_uf_en%5Cu0026utm_source%3Dyoutube%5Cu0026utm_medium%3Dorganicvideo%5Cu0026utm_content%3Dleostartsmart15+%5Cn%5CnTranscript%3A+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BVideo+Overview%3A+Promotion+for+the+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+Account%2C+ideal+as+a+first+teen+or+student+bank+account%2C+or+second+chance+banking+opportunity.+This+video+features+a+young+boy%2C+Leo%2C+13-15+years+old%2C+in+a+convenience+store%2C+purchasing+2+drinks+and+2+family-sized+bags+of+chips%2C+while+his+mother+waits+in+the+car+outside.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWe+open+on+Leo+in+a+convenience+store%2C+holding+two+drinks%2C+and+considering+purchasing+two-family+sized+%E2%80%98Buy-One-Get-One%27+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnThe+Wells+Fargo+Clear+Access+Banking+account+monthly+service+fee+is+%245.+Minimum+opening+deposit+is+%2425.+Other+limitations+apply%2C+see+the+Wells+Fargo+Consumer+Account+Fee+and+Information+Schedule+and+Deposit+Account+Agreement+for+details.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+To+Leo%2C+Buy-One-Get-One+snacks+means+maximizing+his+savings+potential.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+grabs+the+two+bags+of+chips.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+walks+over+to+the+register+and+places+the+drinks+and+chips+on+the+counter.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo+taps+his+card+to+the+scanner+to+pay+the+%246.93+total+for+his+items.+Payment+is+approved.%5D+%5Cn+%5CnVO%3A+However+you+make+money+work%2C+we+can+work+with+that.+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BLeo%E2%80%99s+mom+watches+Leo+exit+with+his+items+looking+unexpectedly+at+his+purchase.%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BWells+Fargo+Sonic+Logo%5D+%5Cn+%5Cn%5BOn+screen+Disclosure%3A+%5Cn+%5CnWells+Fargo+Bank%2C+N.A.+Member+FDIC.%5D%22%7D%2C%22lengthSeconds%22%3A16%2C%22ownerProfileUrl%22%3A%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40wellsfargo%22%2C%22externalChannelId%22%3A%22UCGcBOP3IhbgHOPBcUFUZRdQ%22%2C%22isFamilySafe%22%3Afalse%2C%22availableCountries%22%3A%5B%22AD%22%2C%22AE%22%2C%22AF%22%2C%22AG%22%2C%22AI%22%2C%22AL%22%2C%22AM%22%2C%22AO%22%2C%22AQ%22%2C%22AR%22%2C%22AS%22%2C%22AT%22%2C%22AU%22%2C%22AW%22%2C%22AX%22%2C%22AZ%22%2C%22BA%22%2C%22BB%22%2C%22BD%22%2C%22BE%22%2C%22BF%22%2C%22BG%22%2C%22BH%22%2C%22BI%22%2C%22BJ%22%2C%22BL%22%2C%22BM%22%2C%22BN%22%2C%22BO%22%2C%22BQ%22%2C%22BR%22%2C%22BS%22%2C%22BT%22%2C%22BV%22%2C%22BW%22%2C%22BY%22%2C%22BZ%22%2C%22CA%22%2C%22CC%22%2C%22CD%22%2C%22CF%22%2C%22CG%22%2C%22CH%22%2C%22CI%22%2C%22CK%22%2C%22CL%22%2C%22CM%22%2C%22CN%22%2C%22CO%22%2C%22CR%22%2C%22CU%22%2C%22CV%22%2C%22CW%22%2C%22CX%22%2C%22CY%22%2C%22CZ%22%2C%22DE%22%2C%22DJ%22%2C%22DK%22%2C%22DM%22%2C%22DO%22%2C%22DZ